      "B": "62",
      "C": "68",
      "D": "72"
    },
    "correct_option": "B",
    "answer_html": "<p><strong>Answer:</strong> (B) 62 — The nth term tₙ is Sₙ - Sₙ₋₁. Here t₁₀ = S₁₀ - S₉. S₁₀ = 3(10)² + 5(10) = 300 + 50 = 350. S₉ = 3(9)² + 5(9) = 243 + 45 = 288. Thus t₁₀ = 350 - 288 = 62.</p>",
