    "correct_option": "C",
    "answer_html": "<p><strong>Answer:</strong> (C) 3, 9, 27 — Let the three terms be a/r, a, ar. Product = a³ = 729 ⇒ a = 9. Sum = 9/r + 9 + 9r = 39 ⇒ 9(1/r + r) = 30 ⇒ 3(1/r + r) = 10 ⇒ 3r² - 10r + 3 = 0 ⇒ (3r - 1)(r - 3) = 0. Thus r = 3 or 1/3. The numbers are 3, 9, 27.</p>",
