    "question_html": "<p>A person pays a debt of ₹975 in monthly instalments, each instalment being less than the former by ₹5. If the first instalment is ₹100, the time required to clear the entire debt is:</p>",
    "options": {
      "A": "10 months",
      "B": "15 months",
      "C": "14 months",
      "D": "26 months"
    },
    "correct_option": "B",
    "answer_html": "<p><strong>Answer:</strong> (B) 15 months — Here a = 100, d = -5, S♜ = 975. Using S♜ = (n/2)[2a + (n - 1)d]: 975 = (n/2)[200 - 5(n - 1)] ⇒ 1950 = n(205 - 5n) ⇒ 390 = n(41 - n) ⇒ n² - 41n + 390 = 0 ⇒ (n - 15)(n - 26) = 0. Since n = 26 would make later instalments negative, valid time = 15 months.</p>",
